可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口\\n- 提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要\\n</hidden_step>\\n</system_reminder>\"\n    },\n    \"inputs\": {\n      \"parameters\": {}\n    },\n    \"routing\": {\n      \"selected_skill\": \"frame-sampling\",\n      \"allowed_skills\": [\n        \"analyze-video\",\n        \"batch-video-ingestion\",\n        \"camera-health-check\",\n        \"city-video-intelligence\",\n        \"duplicate-event-merge\",\n        \"evidence-package-generation\",\n        \"evidence-snapshot\",\n        \"ffmpeg-utils\",\n        \"frame-sampling\",\n        \"human-review-routing\",\n        \"object-detection\",\n        \"object-statistics\",\n        \"object-tracking\",\n        \"privacy-masking\",\n        \"roi-mapping\",\n        \"single-video-event-analysis\",\n        \"video-embedding-index\",\n        \"video-object-analytics\",\n        \"video-search\",\n        \"video-segment-extraction\",\n        \"video-stream-ingestion\"\n      ],\n      \"selection_owner\": \"lead_agent\"\n    }\n  },\n  \"legacy_invocation\": {\n    \"skill_dir\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling\",\n    \"skill_file\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/SKILL.md\",\n    \"container_skill_file\": \"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/SKILL.md\",\n    \"selected_data_sources\": [],\n    \"argv\": [],\n    \"env\": {},\n    \"parameters\": {},\n    \"working_directory\": \"/app/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling\",\n    \"adapter_note\": \"Load the returned container_skill_file, follow its SKILL.md workflow, and use selected_data_sources/parameters as the legacy inputs.\"\n  },\n  \"next_steps\": [\n    \"Read container_skill_file before executing the Skill workflow.\",\n    \"Use selected_data_sources and parameters as the legacy inputs.\",\n    \"After execution, call invoke_skill again with mode='wrap_output' to produce SkillResult.\"\n  ]\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"invoke_skill","id":"4c6cc27f-66e9-4aee-91f4-a4b367528f40","tool_call_id":"call_d6615788c2be4bf1a0cd9a0b","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":82,"prompt_tokens":16463,"total_tokens":16545,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":22,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":82},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":16463}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-969ad78f-b186-9c5f-bcaf-ad62350ef76d","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e32-909a-7342-9cea-5a0b594533a6-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"read_file","args":{"description":"读取帧采样技能的工作流程","path":"/mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/SKILL.md"},"id":"call_859f1c3f142e417a822db7dd","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":16463,"output_tokens":82,"total_tokens":16545,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":22}}},{"content":"---\nname: frame-sampling\ndescription: Sample structured frames from an existing video file. Use when Codex has video_path, file_path, raw_segment_uri, camera_id, sampling_strategy, capture_seconds, or provided frame records and needs stable Frame schema outputs. This skill exposes OpenCV-backed real video frame extraction.\n---\n\n# Frame Sampling\n\n## Execution Priority\n\nPrioritize calling this skill's `scripts/run.py` entrypoint first. Only write custom code after the script result is unsuitable or the script cannot cover the requested task.\n\n## Input Resolution\n\nIf the user provides a video file instead of `frames`, do not ask the user to provide frames and do not write custom OpenCV extraction code. Call this skill directly with `camera_id`, `video_path`/`file_path`/`raw_segment_uri`, `capture_seconds`, and `sampling_strategy`. Use `sampling_strategy.mode=interval` and `interval_seconds=1` as the default unless the user requests a different cadence.\n\n\n## Atomic CLI\n\nRun this skill directly with its own script. The script does not call other skill scripts and does not depend on shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n```bash\npython frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video <video.mp4> --camera-id <camera_id> --capture-seconds 10 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir <run_dir> --config <config.json> --output <frames.json>\n```\n\nParameters: `--video`, `--frames-json`, `--camera-id`, `--capture-seconds`, `--interval-seconds`, `--fps`, `--output-dir`, `--config`, `--output`.\n\n## Workflow\n\n1. Read camera id, local video path, and sampling strategy.\n2. Support interval, fps, keyframe, and adaptive strategies when available.\n3. Generate stable frame ids from camera id, timestamp, and sequence.\n4. Store sampled images and return Frame schema records.\n\n## Available Implementation\n\nThis skill is implemented as an atomic standalone script in its own `scripts/run.py`. The script contains the executable logic for this skill and must not import shared `src`, `tools`, or registry modules.\n\n## Inputs\n\nRequired:\n- `camera_id`\n\nCommon fields:\n- `raw_segment_uri`\n- `video_path` or `file_path`\n- `started_at`\n- `capture_seconds`\n- `sampling_strategy.mode`: `interval` or `fps`\n- `sampling_strategy.interval_seconds`\n- `sampling_strategy.fps`\n\n## Outputs\n\nReturns `frames`, each with `frame_id`, `camera_id`, `timestamp`, `image_uri`, `width`, `height`, `sequence`, and for real video `source_elapsed_seconds`.\n\n## Failure Modes\n\n- `MISSING_CAMERA_ID`\n- `VIDEO_OPEN_FAILED`\n\n## Constraints\n\nDo not run detection, tracking, event recognition, or evidence annotation.\n","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"read_file","id":"bb023e5b-a5a4-4475-a00c-70d20d727fb1","tool_call_id":"call_859f1c3f142e417a822db7dd","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"现在开始执行帧采样，从视频中提取关键帧。\n\n","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":93,"prompt_tokens":17150,"total_tokens":17243,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":24,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":93},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":17150}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-127764bf-2671-98e1-8811-b0f10fbd22a0","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e32-9899-7311-9025-f82a9244b6a4-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"mkdir -p /mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output","description":"创建帧采样输出目录"},"id":"call_c1c21d7945f64460a1b3b859","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":17150,"output_tokens":93,"total_tokens":17243,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":24}}},{"content":"(no output)","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"f4a7dad5-6827-49f2-8faa-26997d9dff29","tool_call_id":"call_c1c21d7945f64460a1b3b859","artifact":null,"status":"success"},{"content":"","additional_kwargs":{"refusal":null},"response_metadata":{"token_usage":{"completion_tokens":150,"prompt_tokens":17235,"total_tokens":17385,"completion_tokens_details":{"accepted_prediction_tokens":null,"audio_tokens":null,"reasoning_tokens":19,"rejected_prediction_tokens":null,"text_tokens":150},"prompt_tokens_details":{"audio_tokens":null,"cached_tokens":null,"text_tokens":17235}},"model_provider":"openai","model_name":"qwen3.6-35b-a3b","system_fingerprint":null,"id":"chatcmpl-43eb5d58-b921-9593-aad6-9c57df016ef0","finish_reason":"tool_calls","logprobs":null},"type":"ai","name":null,"id":"lc_run--019f9e32-a42e-71e1-a149-2ac22b69cb95-0","tool_calls":[{"name":"bash","args":{"command":"python /mnt/skills/custom/video_surveillance/frame-sampling/scripts/run.py --video \"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\" --camera-id \"CAM_Traffic_001\" --capture-seconds 2.0 --interval-seconds 1 --output-dir /mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output --output /mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames.json","description":"从视频中采样提取关键帧"},"id":"call_1dc8aa69aa884ab6a9cf6a65","type":"tool_call"}],"invalid_tool_calls":[],"usage_metadata":{"input_tokens":17235,"output_tokens":150,"total_tokens":17385,"input_token_details":{},"output_token_details":{"reasoning":19}}},{"content":"{\n  \"skill\": \"frame-sampling\",\n  \"version\": \"1.0.0\",\n  \"status\": \"success\",\n  \"confidence\": 1.0,\n  \"data\": {\n    \"camera_id\": \"CAM_Traffic_001\",\n    \"frames\": [\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_Traffic_001_202605201000000800_0001\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_Traffic_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:00+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_Traffic_001/CAM_Traffic_001_202605201000000800_0001.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 1,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 0.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_Traffic_001_202605201000010800_0002\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_Traffic_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:01+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_Traffic_001/CAM_Traffic_001_202605201000010800_0002.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 2,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 1.0\n      },\n      {\n        \"frame_id\": \"CAM_Traffic_001_202605201000020800_0003\",\n        \"camera_id\": \"CAM_Traffic_001\",\n        \"timestamp\": \"2026-05-20T10:00:02+08:00\",\n        \"image_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/workspace/frame-sampling-output/frames/CAM_Traffic_001/CAM_Traffic_001_202605201000020800_0003.jpg\",\n        \"width\": 1280,\n        \"height\": 674,\n        \"sequence\": 3,\n        \"source_elapsed_seconds\": 2.0\n      }\n    ],\n    \"source_video_uri\": \"/mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\",\n    \"fps\": 12.0\n  }\n}","additional_kwargs":{},"response_metadata":{},"type":"tool","name":"bash","id":"389b2299-fe77-48bc-a599-5b6f22b20070","tool_call_id":"call_1dc8aa69aa884ab6a9cf6a65","artifact":null,"status":"success"}],"artifacts":[],"intent_context":{"intent":"task","original_query":"这个摄像头的画面是不是有模糊、遮挡或者黑屏的问题？请给出健康状态和评分。","normalized_query":"这个摄像头的画面是不是有模糊、遮挡或者黑屏的问题？请给出健康状态和评分。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将检测这个摄像头的画面是否存在模糊、遮挡或黑屏问题，并输出健康状态和评分","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这个摄像头","监控目标":"模糊、遮挡或者黑屏","输出形式":"健康状态和评分"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_d813e8","text":"这个摄像头的画面是不是有模糊、遮挡或者黑屏的问题？请给出健康状态和评分。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_b94eb8","text":"基于视频监控场景，首先读取并解析指定摄像头的最新视频流或关键帧数据，提取分辨率、有效像素分布及时间戳等基础参数，完成视频样本的结构化清洗与格式校验，输出标准化待检图像数据。"},{"task_span_id":"span_cd700d","text":"针对待检图像调用图像质量评估与缺陷识别能力，分别采用频域对比度分析检测画面模糊程度、利用空间分割算法计算遮挡区域占比、并通过全局亮度阈值判定是否存在黑屏现象，记录各项异常指标的量化数值与触发状态。"},{"task_span_id":"span_93ae6a","text":"将步骤二获取的缺陷量化结果输入安防巡检健康度评估模型，依据不同异常类型对监控有效性的影响权重进行加权计算，对照行业设备巡检分级标准判定健康等级，输出摄像头综合健康评分及对应状态分类。"},{"task_span_id":"span_f9aa5a","text":"整合缺陷检测明细、评分计算逻辑与健康状态结论，按照巡检交付规范生成结构化总结，明确呈现摄像头当前健康状态、具体得分、已识别问题项及后续维护建议，完成最终任务交付。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_4b20dc","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将检测这个摄像头的画面是否存在模糊、遮挡或黑屏问题，并输出健康状态和评分。","params":{"视频对象":"这个摄像头","监控目标":"模糊、遮挡或者黑屏","输出形式":"健康状态和评分"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_4b20dc","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将检测这个摄像头的画面是否存在模糊、遮挡或黑屏问题，并输出健康状态和评分。","params":{"视频对象":"这个摄像头","监控目标":"模糊、遮挡或者黑屏","输出形式":"健康状态和评分"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:e1c982de-3900-40d9-9ac8-a7bb0405c2d8"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n这个摄像头的画面是不是有模糊、遮挡或者黑屏的问题？请给出健康状态和评分。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n这个摄像头的画面是不是有模糊、遮挡或者黑屏的问题？请给出健康状态和评分。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"selection_owner":"le