评分。","routing_query":"场景：视频监控。场景ID：video_surveillance。场景说明：视频监控、摄像头、监控录像、视频流、实时画面、视频帧、卡口、安防巡检、目标检测、行为识别、事件发现和监控告警分析场景。需要识别参数：视频对象、监控目标、时间范围、输出形式。用户原始问题：我将检测这个摄像头的画面是否存在模糊、遮挡或黑屏问题，并输出健康状态和评分","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","params":{"视频对象":"这个摄像头","监控目标":"模糊、遮挡或者黑屏","输出形式":"健康状态和评分"},"scene_mode":"single","scenes":["video_surveillance"],"task_spans":[{"task_span_id":"span_d813e8","text":"这个摄像头的画面是不是有模糊、遮挡或者黑屏的问题？请给出健康状态和评分。"}],"planning_steps":[{"task_span_id":"span_b94eb8","text":"基于视频监控场景，首先读取并解析指定摄像头的最新视频流或关键帧数据，提取分辨率、有效像素分布及时间戳等基础参数，完成视频样本的结构化清洗与格式校验，输出标准化待检图像数据。"},{"task_span_id":"span_cd700d","text":"针对待检图像调用图像质量评估与缺陷识别能力，分别采用频域对比度分析检测画面模糊程度、利用空间分割算法计算遮挡区域占比、并通过全局亮度阈值判定是否存在黑屏现象，记录各项异常指标的量化数值与触发状态。"},{"task_span_id":"span_93ae6a","text":"将步骤二获取的缺陷量化结果输入安防巡检健康度评估模型，依据不同异常类型对监控有效性的影响权重进行加权计算，对照行业设备巡检分级标准判定健康等级，输出摄像头综合健康评分及对应状态分类。"},{"task_span_id":"span_f9aa5a","text":"整合缺陷检测明细、评分计算逻辑与健康状态结论，按照巡检交付规范生成结构化总结，明确呈现摄像头当前健康状态、具体得分、已识别问题项及后续维护建议，完成最终任务交付。"}],"scene_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_4b20dc","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将检测这个摄像头的画面是否存在模糊、遮挡或黑屏问题，并输出健康状态和评分。","params":{"视频对象":"这个摄像头","监控目标":"模糊、遮挡或者黑屏","输出形式":"健康状态和评分"}}],"sub_tasks":[{"sub_task_id":"sub_4b20dc","scene":"video_surveillance","scene_name":"视频监控","text":"我将检测这个摄像头的画面是否存在模糊、遮挡或黑屏问题，并输出健康状态和评分。","params":{"视频对象":"这个摄像头","监控目标":"模糊、遮挡或者黑屏","输出形式":"健康状态和评分"}}],"task_hints":["提取必填参数：视频对象。需要分析的监控视频、摄像头、视频流、录像文件、实时画面、卡口视频或视频帧","提取可选参数：监控目标。需要识别或分析的对象、行为或事件，如人员聚集、车辆违停、越界、烟火、异常停留、摔倒、入侵、打架、遗留物、通行计数等","提取可选参数：时间范围。视频分析的起止时间、日期、时段、时刻或实时窗口","提取可选参数：输出形式。用户期望的输出，如告警、截图、时间点清单、检测结果、表格、报告、标注说明或风险摘要"],"mentioned_skill_ids":[],"confidence":0.9,"reason":"llm_scene_slot_rewrite","_source_message_key":"id:e1c982de-3900-40d9-9ac8-a7bb0405c2d8"},"routing_context":{"route_mode":"scene_filter","trigger":true,"primary_goal":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n这个摄像头的画面是不是有模糊、遮挡或者黑屏的问题？请给出健康状态和评分。","scene_tasks":[{"scene_task_id":"task_001","segment_id":"seg_001","segment_text":"<uploaded_files>\nThe following files were uploaded in this message:\n\n- Trafic-30s.mp4 (1.5 MB)\n  Path: /mnt/user-data/uploads/Trafic-30s.mp4\n\nYou can read these files using the `read_file` tool with the paths shown above.\n</uploaded_files>\n\n这个摄像头的画面是不是有模糊、遮挡或者黑屏的问题？请给出健康状态和评分。","scene":"video_surveillance","input_refs":[],"task_types":[],"selected_skills":[{"id":"analyze-video","role":"primary","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"batch-video-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"camera-health-check","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"city-video-intelligence","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"duplicate-event-merge","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-package-generation","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"evidence-snapshot","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"ffmpeg-utils","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"frame-sampling","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"human-review-routing","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-detection","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-statistics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"object-tracking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"privacy-masking","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"roi-mapping","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"single-video-event-analysis","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-embedding-index","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-object-analytics","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-search","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-segment-extraction","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null},{"id":"video-stream-ingestion","role":"supporting","score":1.0,"reason":null}],"expected_outputs":[],"depends_on":[]}],"global_selected_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"default_public_skill_ids":[],"global_allowed_tools":[],"confidence":1.0,"route_reason":"SkillRouter disabled; injected all custom skills for detected intent scene as LeadAgent candidate skills","allowed_skills":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","video-embedding-index","video-object-analytics","video-search","video-segment-extraction","video-stream-ingestion"],"selection_owner":"lead_agent","_source_message_key":"id:e1c982de-3900-40d9-9ac8-a7bb0405c2d8"},"dialogue_context":{"act":"new_task","confidence":0.7,"reason":"no_pending_action_match","parsed_answer":null,"pending_action_id":null,"resume_intent_context":null,"resume_routing_context":null,"metadata":{}},"final_scope_skill_ids":["analyze-video","batch-video-ingestion","camera-health-check","city-video-intelligence","duplicate-event-merge","evidence-package-generation","evidence-snapshot","ffmpeg-utils","frame-sampling","human-review-routing","object-detection","object-statistics","object-tracking","privacy-masking","roi-mapping","single-video-event-analysis","vid